var documenterSearchIndex = {"docs":
[{"location":"raw_data/#Raw-Data-Workflow","page":"Raw Data Workflow","title":"Raw Data Workflow","text":"This page describes how to generate and update files under data/raw/ using:\n\nscripts/01_download_disprot_data.jl\nscripts/02_download_caid_data.jl\nscripts/03_download_sifts.jl\n\nRun commands from the repository root.","category":"section"},{"location":"raw_data/#Prerequisites","page":"Raw Data Workflow","title":"Prerequisites","text":"Julia installed.\nNetwork access to:\nhttps://disprot.org\nhttps://caid.idpcentral.org\nhttps://ftp.ebi.ac.uk\n\nBoth scripts activate and instantiate scripts/Project.toml automatically.","category":"section"},{"location":"raw_data/#Generate-Or-Update-Raw-Data","page":"Raw Data Workflow","title":"Generate Or Update Raw Data","text":"Run the scripts in this order:\n\njulia scripts/01_download_disprot_data.jl\njulia scripts/02_download_caid_data.jl\njulia scripts/03_download_sifts.jl","category":"section"},{"location":"raw_data/#Optional-CLI-Arguments","page":"Raw Data Workflow","title":"Optional CLI Arguments","text":"DisProt download script (01):\n\njulia scripts/01_download_disprot_data.jl --release 2025_12 --idpo_version 0.3.0\n\n--release: DisProt release identifier.\n--idpo_version: IDPO version identifier.\n\nCAID download script (02):\n\njulia scripts/02_download_caid_data.jl --raw_data_dir data/raw\n\n--raw_data_dir: target root for CAID output folders.\n\nSIFTS download script (03):\n\njulia scripts/03_download_sifts.jl --raw_data_dir data/raw\n\n--raw_data_dir: target root for the SIFTS output folder.","category":"section"},{"location":"raw_data/#Expected-Output-Layout","page":"Raw Data Workflow","title":"Expected Output Layout","text":"After a successful run:\n\ndata/raw/\n|- disprot/\n|  |- README.md\n|  |- disprot_regions.json.gz\n|  |- idpo.json.gz\n|  `- mapping_ontology.tsv.gz\n|- caid_2/\n|  |- README.md\n|  `- *.fasta.gz\n|- caid_3/\n|  |- README.md\n|  `- *.fasta.gz\n`- sifts/\n   |- README.md\n   |- pdb_chain_uniprot.csv.gz\n   `- pdb_chain_cath_uniprot.csv.gz","category":"section"},{"location":"raw_data/#Notes","page":"Raw Data Workflow","title":"Notes","text":"01_download_disprot_data.jl rewrites DisProt files inside data/raw/disprot/.\n02_download_caid_data.jl rewrites CAID files inside data/raw/caid_2/ and data/raw/caid_3/.\n03_download_sifts.jl rewrites SIFTS files inside data/raw/sifts/.\nIf a transient network error occurs, rerun the affected script.","category":"section"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset","text":"Documentation for IDRBindingDataset.\n\n","category":"section"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._add_caid_membership_columns!-Tuple{DataFrames.AbstractDataFrame, Dict{Int64, Set{String}}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._add_caid_membership_columns!","text":"_add_caid_membership_columns!(stats, caid_ids_by_number)\n\nAdd per-protein CAID membership columns to stats and return the list of protein CAID columns that should be considered for cluster CAID assignment.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._any_true-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._any_true","text":"_any_true(values)\n\nReturn true when at least one value in values is a non-missing boolean true.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._append_missing_release_statuses_for_codes!-Tuple{AbstractDict, AbstractDict, AbstractVector{<:AbstractString}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._append_missing_release_statuses_for_codes!","text":"_append_missing_release_statuses_for_codes!(\n    missing_release_pdb_status,\n    pdb_release_dates,\n    pdb_codes;\n    holding_status_fetcher\n)\n\nFor pdb_codes with missing release date, fetch holdings statuses (if not already present) and merge them into missing_release_pdb_status.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._append_replacement_rows!-Tuple{Vector{NamedTuple}, DataFrames.DataFrame, AbstractDict, AbstractDict, NamedTuple}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._append_replacement_rows!","text":"_append_replacement_rows!(\n    rows,\n    disprot_pdb_map,\n    missing_release_pdb_status,\n    pdb_release_dates,\n    default_pdb_status\n)\n\nAppend one row per replacement PDB for obsolete entries, preserving the source UniProt accession. A replacement row is only added when (acc, replacement_pdb) is not already present.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._attempt_download-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString, Function, Function, Bool}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._attempt_download","text":"_attempt_download(url, destination, downloader, logger, log_success)\n\nRun a single atomic download attempt into destination.\n\nThe payload is first downloaded into a temporary file in the destination folder and only moved into place on success.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._build_all_vs_all_blastp_args-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._build_all_vs_all_blastp_args","text":"_build_all_vs_all_blastp_args(input_fasta_path, db_prefix, blast_output_path; threads)\n\nBuild DIAMOND blastp arguments for all-vs-all local homology discovery.\n\nParameter rationale:\n\n--evalue 1000: keep search permissive; final inclusion is controlled by explicit Julia-side thresholds (identity, coverage, ungapped length).\n--max-target-seqs 0: keep all candidate neighbors for graph edges.\n--max-hsps 0: keep alternative local alignments (needed for local homology).\n--no-self-hits: suppress trivial self alignments.\n--ultra-sensitive: maximize sensitivity for local hit discovery.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._build_cluster_assignments-Tuple{AbstractString, Vector{Vector{String}}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._build_cluster_assignments","text":"_build_cluster_assignments(mode_prefix, components)\n\nConvert connected components to a deterministic cluster-assignment table with columns: cluster_id, representative_id, sequence_id, cluster_size.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._build_cluster_split_labels-Tuple{DataFrames.AbstractDataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._build_cluster_split_labels","text":"_build_cluster_split_labels(stats)\n\nBuild one row per final_cluster_id containing:\n\ncluster_in_af2_training_set\none cluster_in_caid<N> column per CAID dataset present\ncluster_fixed_dataset_label\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._build_fixed_labels_table_from_caid_datasets-Tuple{DataFrames.AbstractDataFrame, DataFrames.AbstractDataFrame, DataFrames.AbstractDataFrame, Dict{Int64, Set{String}}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._build_fixed_labels_table_from_caid_datasets","text":"build_fixed_labels_table(\n    cluster_representatives,\n    disprot_annotations,\n    oldest_pdb_release_dates,\n    caid2_disprot_ids,\n    caid3_disprot_ids;\n    af2_training_cutoff_date = AF2_TRAINING_DATA_CUTOFF_DATE\n)\n\nBuild one per-protein table containing all fixed-label inputs and outputs used for deterministic split assignment.\n\nReturned columns include:\n\nall columns from cluster_representatives,\nprotein_disprot_id,\nprotein_has_idr_binding_annotation,\nprotein_oldest_pdb_release_date,\nprotein_has_pdb_structure,\nprotein_has_missing_pdb_release_date,\nprotein_in_caid2,\nprotein_in_caid3,\noptional additional CAID membership columns: protein_in_caid<N>,\nprotein_in_af2_training_set,\ncluster_in_af2_training_set,\ncluster_in_caid2,\ncluster_in_caid3,\noptional additional CAID cluster columns: cluster_in_caid<N>,\ncluster_fixed_dataset_label.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._build_global_cluster_args-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._build_global_cluster_args","text":"_build_global_cluster_args(input_fasta_path, cluster_output_path; threads, memory_limit)\n\nBuild DIAMOND cluster arguments for the global criterion.\n\nParameter rationale:\n\n--approx-id: configured global identity threshold for clustering.\n--mutual-cover: configured bidirectional coverage requirement.\n--memory-limit: explicit memory control for deterministic runtime behavior.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._build_global_recluster_args-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._build_global_recluster_args","text":"_build_global_recluster_args(input_fasta_path, input_clusters_path, output_clusters_path; threads, memory_limit)\n\nBuild DIAMOND recluster arguments for the global criterion.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._build_invalid_merged_pdb_references-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame, DataFrames.DataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._build_invalid_merged_pdb_references","text":"_build_invalid_merged_pdb_references(merged_pdb_references, cleaned_merged_pdb_rows)\n\nBuild a table of raw references that contain no extractable canonical PDB ID. This reuses already-expanded cleaned rows to avoid re-running regex extraction.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._build_pdb_release_map_row-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString, AbstractDict, AbstractDict, NamedTuple}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._build_pdb_release_map_row","text":"_build_pdb_release_map_row(\n    acc,\n    pdb,\n    pdb_release_dates,\n    missing_release_pdb_status,\n    default_pdb_status\n)\n\nBuild one annotated (acc, pdb) output row with release-date and holdings-status metadata.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._bytes_and_mb_string-Tuple{Integer}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._bytes_and_mb_string","text":"_bytes_and_mb_string(size_in_bytes)\n\nRender a file size as bytes plus decimal megabytes.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._bytes_to_mb-Tuple{Integer}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._bytes_to_mb","text":"_bytes_to_mb(bytes)\n\nConvert bytes to decimal megabytes.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._caid_fasta_prefix_validator-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._caid_fasta_prefix_validator","text":"_caid_fasta_prefix_validator(path)\n\nValidate that a downloaded CAID FASTA file starts with >DP.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._caid_ids_by_number-Tuple{AbstractDict}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._caid_ids_by_number","text":"_caid_ids_by_number(caid_disprot_ids_by_dataset)\n\nNormalize CAID dataset ID collections to Dict{Int, Set{String}} keyed by dataset number.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._caid_number_from_membership_column-Tuple{Symbol, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._caid_number_from_membership_column","text":"_caid_number_from_membership_column(column_name, prefix)\n\nExtract the CAID dataset number from one membership column name, for example:\n\nprotein_in_caid4 -> 4\ncluster_in_caid4 -> 4\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._cluster_assignments_from_diamond_cluster_pairs-Tuple{Vector{String}, Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._cluster_assignments_from_diamond_cluster_pairs","text":"_cluster_assignments_from_diamond_cluster_pairs(sequence_ids, pairs)\n\nConvert (representative, member) pairs from diamond cluster output into a deterministic assignment table.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._cluster_label_with_disprot_cutoff-Tuple{Any, Union{Missing, Dates.Date}, Dates.Date}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._cluster_label_with_disprot_cutoff","text":"_cluster_label_with_disprot_cutoff(\n    fixed_label,\n    cluster_min_oldest_disprot_release_date,\n    disprot_testing_cutoff_date\n)\n\nResolve one cluster label:\n\nkeep fixed_label when present,\notherwise assign testing when cluster minimum oldest DisProt release date is after disprot_testing_cutoff_date,\notherwise assign training.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._complete_split_label_summary_rows-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._complete_split_label_summary_rows","text":"_complete_split_label_summary_rows(summary)\n\nEnsure summary contains one row for each split label (training, caid, testing) with zero-filled count columns when missing.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._components_from_disjoint_set!-Tuple{DataStructures.IntDisjointSet, Vector{String}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._components_from_disjoint_set!","text":"_components_from_disjoint_set!(disjoint_set, sequence_ids)\n\nBuild deterministic connected components from disjoint_set membership.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._count_labels-Tuple{DataFrames.AbstractDataFrame, Symbol}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._count_labels","text":"_count_labels(table, label_column)\n\nCount rows by string-normalized values in label_column.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._count_true-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._count_true","text":"_count_true(values)\n\nCount values that are non-missing booleans equal to true.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._default_rcsb_status_get_request-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._default_rcsb_status_get_request","text":"_default_rcsb_status_get_request(url)\n\nRun one holdings-status GET request without throwing on non-2xx statuses.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._diamond_cmd-Tuple{AbstractVector{<:AbstractString}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._diamond_cmd","text":"_diamond_cmd(args)\n\nBuild a DIAMOND command by appending args to the JLL-provided executable.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._discover_caid_binding_datasets-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._discover_caid_binding_datasets","text":"_discover_caid_binding_datasets(raw_data_dir)\n\nDiscover CAID datasets by listing folders under raw_data_dir whose names start with caid_. Each discovered folder must contain binding.fasta.gz.\n\nReturns a vector of named tuples:\n\nname\nnumber\nbinding_fasta_path\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._disprot_release_dates_for_entry-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._disprot_release_dates_for_entry","text":"_disprot_release_dates_for_entry(entry)\n\nCollect all release tags available for one DisProt protein entry (protein-level and region-level), normalized as Union{Missing, Date}.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._download_caid_dataset-Tuple{Any, AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._download_caid_dataset","text":"_download_caid_dataset(dataset, raw_data_dir, timestamp_utc; logger = println)\n\nDownload one CAID dataset into its folder, validate raw FASTA headers, gzip files, and write a per-folder README.md.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._download_sifts_summary_file-Tuple{Type{<:MIToS.SIFTS.DataBase}, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._download_sifts_summary_file","text":"_download_sifts_summary_file(database, folder_path; logger = println)\n\nDownload one SIFTS summary file into folder_path and return its metadata.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._expand_merged_pdb_references-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._expand_merged_pdb_references","text":"_expand_merged_pdb_references(merged_pdb_references)\n\nExpand raw merged references to one row per extracted canonical PDB ID using DataFrames row-wise transformations.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._expanded_reference_rows-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._expanded_reference_rows","text":"_expanded_reference_rows(acc, pdb_reference)\n\nReturn cleaned PDB rows extracted from one raw (acc, pdb_reference) pair.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._extract_caid_dataset_number-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._extract_caid_dataset_number","text":"_extract_caid_dataset_number(dataset_key)\n\nExtract a CAID dataset number from one dataset key (Int or caid_<N> string).\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._extract_release_dates_from_response-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractVector{<:AbstractString}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._extract_release_dates_from_response","text":"_extract_release_dates_from_response(response_body, batch_ids)\n\nParse one GraphQL response and return a dictionary from PDB ID to release date. Missing or unknown IDs are represented with missing.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._final_cluster_ids-Tuple{Vector{String}, Vector{String}, Vector{String}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._final_cluster_ids","text":"_final_cluster_ids(protein_ids, global_representative_ids, local_representative_ids)\n\nBuild deterministic final cluster identifiers by taking the transitive closure of co-membership across global and local representative assignments.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._fixed_dataset_label_for_cluster-NTuple{4, Bool}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._fixed_dataset_label_for_cluster","text":"_fixed_dataset_label_for_cluster(\n    cluster_has_caid,\n    cluster_has_af2_training_structure,\n    cluster_has_pdb_structure,\n    cluster_has_missing_pdb_release_date\n)\n\nReturn the fixed dataset label for one final cluster according to the split rules:\n\ncaid overrides all if cluster has CAID members,\notherwise training if cluster has AF2-pre-cutoff structures,\notherwise training (conservative) if cluster has PDB structures and missing release dates,\notherwise missing (unassigned).\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._format_mb-Tuple{Integer}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._format_mb","text":"_format_mb(bytes)\n\nConvert bytes to decimal megabytes and round to 4 decimal digits.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._get_rcsb_holding_status_with_retries-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._get_rcsb_holding_status_with_retries","text":"_get_rcsb_holding_status_with_retries(pdb_id; max_retries, base_sleep, get_request, sleeper)\n\nFetch one holdings-status response for pdb_id, retrying on transient failures and HTTP 429 responses.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._header_primary_token-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._header_primary_token","text":"_header_primary_token(header)\n\nExtract the first whitespace-delimited token from a FASTA header string.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._local_cluster_assignments_from_blastp-Tuple{AbstractString, Vector{String}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._local_cluster_assignments_from_blastp","text":"_local_cluster_assignments_from_blastp(input_fasta_path, sequence_ids; threads)\n\nRun all-vs-all blastp, parse hits, and build local assignments.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._local_cluster_assignments_from_hits-Tuple{Vector{String}, Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._local_cluster_assignments_from_hits","text":"_local_cluster_assignments_from_hits(sequence_ids, hits)\n\nConstruct local cluster assignments by filtering hits and grouping accepted edges with disjoint-set connected components.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._markdown_value-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._markdown_value","text":"_markdown_value(value)\n\nRender one value for README markdown output, using missing for absent values.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._minimum_date_or_missing-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._minimum_date_or_missing","text":"_minimum_date_or_missing(values)\n\nReturn the oldest non-missing date in values, or missing when no date is available.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._missing_release_pdb_codes-Tuple{AbstractVector{<:AbstractString}, AbstractDict}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._missing_release_pdb_codes","text":"_missing_release_pdb_codes(pdb_codes, pdb_release_dates)\n\nReturn canonical PDB IDs with missing release-date records.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._normalize_caid_source_paths_by_version-Tuple{}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._normalize_caid_source_paths_by_version","text":"_normalize_caid_source_paths_by_version(; kwargs...)\n\nNormalize CAID source FASTA paths to Dict{Int, String} keyed by CAID version.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._normalize_disprot_release_tag-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._normalize_disprot_release_tag","text":"_normalize_disprot_release_tag(value)\n\nNormalize one DisProt release tag (YYYY_MM) to Union{Missing, Date}.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._normalize_disprot_sequence-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._normalize_disprot_sequence","text":"_normalize_disprot_sequence(sequence)\n\nNormalize a DisProt protein sequence by trimming whitespace and uppercasing. Only alphabetic amino-acid letters (A-Z) are accepted.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._normalize_label_for_report-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._normalize_label_for_report","text":"_normalize_label_for_report(label)\n\nNormalize a split label for reporting, using \"missing\" for missing values.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._normalize_oldest_pdb_release_dates_table-Tuple{DataFrames.AbstractDataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._normalize_oldest_pdb_release_dates_table","text":"_normalize_oldest_pdb_release_dates_table(oldest_pdb_release_dates)\n\nEnsure that oldest_pdb_release_dates includes:\n\nacc\noldest_pdb_release_date\nhas_pdb_structure\nhas_missing_pdb_release_date\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._normalize_optional_bool_column!-Tuple{DataFrames.AbstractDataFrame, Symbol}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._normalize_optional_bool_column!","text":"_normalize_optional_bool_column!(df, column_name)\n\nNormalize an optional boolean column in-place, replacing missing with false.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._normalize_optional_string-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._normalize_optional_string","text":"_normalize_optional_string(value; uppercase_output = false)\n\nNormalize an optional JSON field into Union{Missing,String}.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._normalize_pdb_ids-Tuple{AbstractVector{<:AbstractString}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._normalize_pdb_ids","text":"_normalize_pdb_ids(pdb_ids)\n\nNormalize PDB identifiers by trimming whitespace and converting to uppercase.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._normalize_pdb_release_date-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._normalize_pdb_release_date","text":"_normalize_pdb_release_date(value)\n\nNormalize one raw PDB release-date value to Union{Missing, Date}.\n\nAccepted values:\n\nDate\nmissing\nstrings in yyyy-mm-dd format\nstrings equal to missing (case-insensitive), which are converted to missing\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._parse_date_argument-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._parse_date_argument","text":"_parse_date_argument(date_text, argument_name)\n\nParse one date argument in yyyy-mm-dd format and throw an ArgumentError for invalid input.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._parse_diamond_cluster_pairs-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._parse_diamond_cluster_pairs","text":"_parse_diamond_cluster_pairs(cluster_output_path)\n\nRead representative/member pairs from DIAMOND cluster tabular output.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._parse_holding_status_response-Tuple{HTTP.Messages.Response}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._parse_holding_status_response","text":"_parse_holding_status_response(response)\n\nParse one RCSB holdings status response into a typed status tuple.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._parse_release_date-Tuple{Any, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._parse_release_date","text":"_parse_release_date(raw_date, pdb_id)\n\nParse an RCSB initial_release_date value into Date. Returns missing when the API explicitly reports a missing date.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._passes_local_filter-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._passes_local_filter","text":"_passes_local_filter(hit)\n\nCheck whether a hit satisfies the local criterion:\n\nidentity >= LOCAL_CLUSTER_MIN_IDENTITY,\nungapped alignment (gapopen == 0),\naligned length >= LOCAL_CLUSTER_MIN_UNGAPPED_LENGTH.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._post_rcsb_graphql_with_retries-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._post_rcsb_graphql_with_retries","text":"_post_rcsb_graphql_with_retries(body; max_retries, base_sleep, post_request, sleeper)\n\nPOST one GraphQL payload to RCSB with bounded retries.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._read_diamond_blastp_hits_tsv-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._read_diamond_blastp_hits_tsv","text":"_read_diamond_blastp_hits_tsv(blast_output_path)\n\nRead DIAMOND outfmt-6 blastp hits as a typed DataFrame.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._read_disprot_entries-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._read_disprot_entries","text":"_read_disprot_entries(disprot_regions_path)\n\nRead a DisProt compressed JSON regions file and return the data entries array.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._read_fasta_ids-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._read_fasta_ids","text":"_read_fasta_ids(input_fasta_path)\n\nRead unique FASTA sequence identifiers from input_fasta_path. FASTA parsing is delegated to MIToS.MSA.read_file(..., FASTASequences).\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._read_sifts_uniprot_df-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._read_sifts_uniprot_df","text":"_read_sifts_uniprot_df(sifts_uniprot_path)\n\nRead the SIFTS UniProt summary file and return it as a DataFrame.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._region_has_idr_binding_annotation-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._region_has_idr_binding_annotation","text":"_region_has_idr_binding_annotation(region)\n\nReturn true when one region is annotated as binding. The function prioritizes the explicit term_is_binding flag, with a fallback to term_name containing the word binding.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._render_caid_source_lines-Tuple{Dict{Int64, String}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._render_caid_source_lines","text":"_render_caid_source_lines(paths_by_version)\n\nRender markdown bullet lines for CAID source paths using keys named source_caidN_binding_fasta_path.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._render_readme_summary_lines-Tuple{Dict{String, Int64}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._render_readme_summary_lines","text":"_render_readme_summary_lines(label_counts; prefix)\n\nRender markdown bullet lines for one summary dictionary.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._replacement_pdb_codes-Tuple{AbstractDict}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._replacement_pdb_codes","text":"_replacement_pdb_codes(missing_release_pdb_status)\n\nReturn unique replacement PDB IDs extracted from holdings-status records.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._request_with_retries-Tuple{Function}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._request_with_retries","text":"_request_with_retries(\n    request_fn;\n    max_retries,\n    base_sleep,\n    sleeper,\n    is_success_response,\n    failure_prefix\n)\n\nRun one HTTP request with bounded retries and shared backoff logic.\n\nRetries on non-success responses and exceptions.\nUses Retry-After when HTTP status is 429.\nEmits consistent terminal errors containing last status and last exception.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._require_caid_dataset_path-Tuple{AbstractVector, Integer}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._require_caid_dataset_path","text":"_require_caid_dataset_path(caid_datasets, required_number)\n\nReturn the binding FASTA path for one required CAID dataset number.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._require_columns-Tuple{DataFrames.AbstractDataFrame, AbstractVector{Symbol}, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._require_columns","text":"_require_columns(df, required_columns, table_name)\n\nValidate that df contains all required_columns. Throws an ArgumentError listing missing columns when validation fails.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._retry_after_seconds-Tuple{HTTP.Messages.Response, Real, Integer}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._retry_after_seconds","text":"_retry_after_seconds(response, base_sleep, attempt)\n\nReturn the wait duration for an HTTP 429 response. If Retry-After is not present or cannot be parsed, this falls back to exponential backoff.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._retry_last_status_message-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._retry_last_status_message","text":"_retry_last_status_message(last_status)\n\nRender the terminal HTTP-status message for retry-failure errors.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._retry_sleep_seconds_for_exception-Tuple{Real, Integer}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._retry_sleep_seconds_for_exception","text":"_retry_sleep_seconds_for_exception(base_sleep, attempt)\n\nReturn retry sleep duration for one transport/connection exception.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._retry_sleep_seconds_for_status-Tuple{HTTP.Messages.Response, Real, Integer}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._retry_sleep_seconds_for_status","text":"_retry_sleep_seconds_for_status(response, base_sleep, attempt)\n\nReturn retry sleep duration for one non-success HTTP response.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._run_all_vs_all_blastp-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._run_all_vs_all_blastp","text":"_run_all_vs_all_blastp(input_fasta_path, blast_output_path; threads)\n\nRun DIAMOND all-vs-all blastp for one FASTA file and write tabular output with fields required by both clustering modes.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._run_checked_command-Tuple{Cmd, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._run_checked_command","text":"_run_checked_command(cmd, context)\n\nRun cmd and throw a descriptive error if it exits with a non-zero status.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._run_global_diamond_cluster-Tuple{AbstractString, Vector{String}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._run_global_diamond_cluster","text":"_run_global_diamond_cluster(input_fasta_path, sequence_ids; threads, memory_limit)\n\nRun diamond cluster + diamond recluster for the global criterion and convert the refined output pairs to a deterministic assignment table.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._sequence_index_map-Tuple{Vector{String}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._sequence_index_map","text":"_sequence_index_map(sequence_ids)\n\nBuild a sequence identifier to index mapping for disjoint-set operations.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._sifts_mapping_description-Tuple{Type{<:MIToS.SIFTS.DataBase}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._sifts_mapping_description","text":"_sifts_mapping_description(database)\n\nReturn a human-readable mapping description for one SIFTS summary database.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._single_nonmissing_or_missing-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._single_nonmissing_or_missing","text":"_single_nonmissing_or_missing(values; value_label = \"value\")\n\nReturn the single non-missing value in values, or missing when all values are missing. Throws an ArgumentError when multiple distinct non-missing values are found.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._split_label_sort_key-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._split_label_sort_key","text":"_split_label_sort_key(label)\n\nReturn a stable order key for split labels (training, caid, testing), with unrecognized labels sorted after known labels.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._to_string_set-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._to_string_set","text":"_to_string_set(values)\n\nNormalize an iterable collection of identifiers to a Set{String}.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._union_group_members!-Tuple{DataStructures.IntDisjointSet, Dict{String, Vector{Int64}}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._union_group_members!","text":"_union_group_members!(disjoint_set, grouped_indices)\n\nUnion all indices that share the same group key.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._validate_clustering_thresholds-Tuple{}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._validate_clustering_thresholds","text":"_validate_clustering_thresholds(;\n    global_min_coverage,\n    global_min_identity,\n    local_min_identity,\n    local_min_ungapped_length)\n\nValidate clustering thresholds and return a normalized named tuple.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._write_caid_folder_readme-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString, AbstractString, Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._write_caid_folder_readme","text":"_write_caid_folder_readme(folder_path, challenge, timestamp_utc, entries)\n\nWrite README.md metadata for a CAID raw-data folder.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._write_sifts_folder_readme-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString, Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._write_sifts_folder_readme","text":"_write_sifts_folder_readme(folder_path, timestamp_utc, entries)\n\nWrite README.md metadata for a SIFTS raw-data folder.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset._write_text_output-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset._write_text_output","text":"_write_text_output(path, content)\n\nWrite plain text to path.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.assign_missing_cluster_labels_by_disprot_cutoff-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.assign_missing_cluster_labels_by_disprot_cutoff","text":"assign_missing_cluster_labels_by_disprot_cutoff(\n    dataset_stats;\n    disprot_testing_cutoff_date\n)\n\nAdd a cutoff-based label for clusters with missing fixed labels.\n\nRequired dataset_stats columns:\n\nfinal_cluster_id\ncluster_fixed_dataset_label\nprotein_oldest_disprot_release_date\n\nReturned table includes all input columns plus:\n\ncluster_min_protein_oldest_disprot_release_date\ncluster_disprot_cutoff_dataset_label\n\nRules:\n\nKeep existing cluster_fixed_dataset_label values (training, caid) unchanged.\nFor clusters with missing fixed labels:\nassign testing when cluster_min_protein_oldest_disprot_release_date > disprot_testing_cutoff_date;\notherwise assign training.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_cluster_representatives_table-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame, DataFrames.DataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_cluster_representatives_table","text":"build_cluster_representatives_table(global_assignments, local_assignments)\n\nBuild a final one-row-per-protein table with columns:\n\nprotein_id\nglobal_representative_id\nlocal_representative_id\nfinal_cluster_id\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_dataset_stats_table-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame, Any, DataFrames.DataFrame, Any, Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_dataset_stats_table","text":"build_dataset_stats_table(\n    cluster_representatives,\n    disprot_entries,\n    pdb_release_map,\n    caid2_disprot_ids,\n    caid3_disprot_ids;\n    af2_training_cutoff_date = AF2_TRAINING_DATA_CUTOFF_DATE\n)\n\nConvenience overload that derives the DisProt annotation and oldest-PDB tables from raw DisProt entries and raw PDB release-map rows.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_dataset_stats_table-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame, DataFrames.DataFrame, DataFrames.DataFrame, Any, Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_dataset_stats_table","text":"build_dataset_stats_table(\n    cluster_representatives,\n    disprot_annotations,\n    oldest_pdb_release_dates,\n    caid2_disprot_ids,\n    caid3_disprot_ids;\n    af2_training_cutoff_date = AF2_TRAINING_DATA_CUTOFF_DATE\n)\n\nBuild the per-protein stats table used for cluster-distribution analysis.\n\nOutput columns include all columns from cluster_representatives, plus:\n\nprotein_disprot_id\nprotein_oldest_disprot_release_date\nprotein_has_idr_binding_annotation\nprotein_oldest_pdb_release_date\nprotein_has_pdb_structure\nprotein_has_missing_pdb_release_date\nprotein_in_caid2\nprotein_in_caid3\nprotein_in_af2_training_set\ncluster_in_af2_training_set\ncluster_in_caid2\ncluster_in_caid3\ncluster_fixed_dataset_label (training, caid, or missing)\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_disprot_protein_annotations-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_disprot_protein_annotations","text":"build_disprot_protein_annotations(disprot_entries)\n\nBuild one row per DisProt protein with:\n\nacc\ndisprot_id\noldest_disprot_release_date\nhas_idr_binding_annotation\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_disprot_regions_url-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_disprot_regions_url","text":"build_disprot_regions_url(release)\n\nBuild the DisProt API URL for retrieving all entries of a release, including ambiguous regions and excluding obsolete ones.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_disprot_release_dates-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_disprot_release_dates","text":"build_disprot_release_dates(disprot_entries)\n\nExtract all DisProt release dates from protein-level and region-level release tags and return unique sorted dates.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_disprot_sifts_pdb_comparison-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame, DataFrames.DataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_disprot_sifts_pdb_comparison","text":"build_disprot_sifts_pdb_comparison(disprot_uniprot_pdb_map, sifts_uniprot_pdb_map)\n\nOuter-join DisProt and SIFTS UniProt-PDB maps and add mapping_status labels:\n\nboth\nonly_disprot\nonly_sifts\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_fixed_labels_table-Tuple{DataFrames.AbstractDataFrame, DataFrames.AbstractDataFrame, DataFrames.AbstractDataFrame, AbstractDict}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_fixed_labels_table","text":"build_fixed_labels_table(\n    cluster_representatives,\n    disprot_annotations,\n    oldest_pdb_release_dates,\n    caid_disprot_ids_by_dataset;\n    af2_training_cutoff_date = AF2_TRAINING_DATA_CUTOFF_DATE\n)\n\nBuild fixed labels from many CAID dataset ID collections, keyed by dataset name (for example caid_2, caid_3, caid_4) or by integer dataset number.\n\nColumns protein_in_caid2 and protein_in_caid3 retain their existing meanings. Additional CAID datasets are handled independently for fixed-label assignment without being merged into protein_in_caid3.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_fixed_labels_table-Tuple{DataFrames.AbstractDataFrame, DataFrames.AbstractDataFrame, DataFrames.AbstractDataFrame, Any, Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_fixed_labels_table","text":"build_fixed_labels_table(\n    cluster_representatives,\n    disprot_annotations,\n    oldest_pdb_release_dates,\n    caid2_disprot_ids,\n    caid3_disprot_ids;\n    af2_training_cutoff_date = AF2_TRAINING_DATA_CUTOFF_DATE\n)\n\nBuild fixed labels from explicit CAID-2 and CAID-3 DisProt ID collections.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_oldest_pdb_release_dates-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_oldest_pdb_release_dates","text":"build_oldest_pdb_release_dates(pdb_release_map)\n\nCollapse a PDB release-date table to one row per UniProt accession with the oldest available PDB release date.\n\nExpected input columns:\n\nacc\npdb_release_date\n\nReturns a DataFrame with columns:\n\nacc\noldest_pdb_release_date\nhas_pdb_structure\nhas_missing_pdb_release_date\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_pdb_release_map_from_comparison-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_pdb_release_map_from_comparison","text":"build_pdb_release_map_from_comparison(\n    disprot_sifts_pdb_comparison;\n    batch_size = 300,\n    release_date_fetcher = fetch_pdb_initial_release_dates,\n    holding_status_fetcher = fetch_pdb_holding_statuses\n)\n\nBuild cleaned UniProt-PDB tables and release-date/status annotations starting from a merged DisProt/SIFTS comparison table.\n\nReturns a named tuple containing intermediate and final tables, including:\n\ndisprot_pdb_map_with_release\nfailed_pdb_lookups\ninvalid_merged_pdb_references\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_pdb_release_map_from_raw-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_pdb_release_map_from_raw","text":"build_pdb_release_map_from_raw(\n    raw_data_dir;\n    batch_size = 300,\n    release_date_fetcher = fetch_pdb_initial_release_dates,\n    holding_status_fetcher = fetch_pdb_holding_statuses\n)\n\nBuild the full UniProt-PDB release-date dataset from repository raw inputs.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_sifts_uniprot_pdb_map_for_disprot-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame, Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_sifts_uniprot_pdb_map_for_disprot","text":"build_sifts_uniprot_pdb_map_for_disprot(sifts_uniprot_df, disprot_uniprot_ids)\n\nBuild a unique SIFTS UniProt-PDB map restricted to DisProt UniProt IDs.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.build_unique_uniprot_pdb_map-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.build_unique_uniprot_pdb_map","text":"build_unique_uniprot_pdb_map(region_level_pdb_refs)\n\nCollapse region-level references into one row per unique (acc, pdb) pair.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.classify_pdb_lookup_status-Tuple{Union{Missing, Dates.Date}, NamedTuple{(:http_status, :status, :status_code, :replacement_pdb)}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.classify_pdb_lookup_status","text":"classify_pdb_lookup_status(release_date, holding_status)\n\nClassify one PDB lookup result into one of:\n\ncurrent\nobsolete\ninvalid_or_not_found\ncurrent_without_release_date\nunresolved\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.clean_directory-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.clean_directory","text":"clean_directory(path)\n\nRemove path recursively if it exists, then recreate it as an empty directory.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.collect_disprot_region_level_pdb_refs-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.collect_disprot_region_level_pdb_refs","text":"collect_disprot_region_level_pdb_refs(disprot_entries)\n\nCollect region-level DisProt PDB cross references into a tidy table with columns:\n\nacc\npdb\npdb_reference (raw cross-reference value)\n\nPDB IDs are cleaned using extract_pdb_codes.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.download_caid_reference_data-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.download_caid_reference_data","text":"download_caid_reference_data(\n    raw_data_dir;\n    timestamp_utc = utc_now_iso8601(),\n    logger = println,\n    datasets = CAID_DATASETS\n)\n\nDownload CAID-2 and CAID-3 reference FASTA files into raw_data_dir, regenerate their folder READMEs.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.download_sifts_reference_data-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.download_sifts_reference_data","text":"download_sifts_reference_data(\n    raw_data_dir;\n    timestamp_utc = utc_now_iso8601(),\n    logger = println\n)\n\nDownload SIFTS chain-level summary CSV files for UniProt and CATH into joinpath(raw_data_dir, \"sifts\"), preserving gzip compression and regenerating the folder README.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.download_to_file_with_retries-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.download_to_file_with_retries","text":"download_to_file_with_retries(url, destination;\n    delays = ExponentialBackOff(n = 5), downloader = Downloads.download,\n    logger = println, log_success = true)\n\nDownload url into destination using atomic writes and bounded retries. If all attempts fail, the last exception is rethrown.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.download_to_gzip_file_with_retries-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.download_to_gzip_file_with_retries","text":"download_to_gzip_file_with_retries(url, destination;\n    delays = ExponentialBackOff(n = 5), downloader = Downloads.download,\n    logger = println, precompress_validator = nothing)\n\nDownload url, compress it as gzip, and save it to destination.\n\nIf precompress_validator is provided, it is called with the path to the downloaded temporary uncompressed file before compression starts.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.ensure_files_within_size_limit-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.ensure_files_within_size_limit","text":"ensure_files_within_size_limit(paths; max_bytes, limit_name, remediation)\n\nValidate that all files in paths exist and are smaller than or equal to max_bytes.\n\nIf any file is missing or exceeds the configured limit, this function throws an ErrorException with a clear multi-line diagnostic.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.extract_disprot_full_protein_sequences-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.extract_disprot_full_protein_sequences","text":"extract_disprot_full_protein_sequences(disprot_entries)\n\nExtract one (acc, sequence) pair per DisProt protein entry.\n\nValidation rules:\n\nacc must be present and non-empty,\nsequence must be present and non-empty,\naccessions must be unique,\nsequences are normalized by _normalize_disprot_sequence.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.extract_pdb_codes-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.extract_pdb_codes","text":"extract_pdb_codes(reference)\n\nExtract canonical 4-character PDB identifiers from one raw reference string.\n\nAccepted patterns include raw IDs (1ABC), IDs with chain suffixes (1ABC:A, 1ABC_A), prefixed IDs (PDB:1ABC), and concatenated strings where IDs are token-delimited (for example 1ABC;PDB:2DEF).\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.fetch_pdb_holding_statuses-Tuple{AbstractVector{<:AbstractString}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.fetch_pdb_holding_statuses","text":"fetch_pdb_holding_statuses(\n    pdb_ids;\n    max_retries = 5,\n    base_sleep = 0.5\n)\n\nFetch RCSB holdings status records for canonical 4-character PDB IDs.\n\nReturns Dict{String,PDBHoldingStatus} keyed by uppercase PDB ID.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.fetch_pdb_initial_release_dates-Tuple{AbstractVector{<:AbstractString}}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.fetch_pdb_initial_release_dates","text":"fetch_pdb_initial_release_dates(\n    pdb_ids;\n    batch_size = 300,\n    max_retries = 5,\n    base_sleep = 0.5\n)\n\nFetch initial PDB release dates from the RCSB GraphQL API for pdb_ids.\n\nReturns Dict{String,Union{Missing,Date}} keyed by normalized uppercase PDB ID. Any unknown ID is included with value missing.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.parse_disprot_release-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.parse_disprot_release","text":"parse_disprot_release(release)\n\nParse a DisProt release tag in YYYY_MM format into a Date at the first day of that month.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.read_caid_disprot_ids-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.read_caid_disprot_ids","text":"read_caid_disprot_ids(caid_binding_fasta_gz_path)\n\nRead one CAID FASTA .gz file and return the unique DisProt IDs found in FASTA headers.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.read_disprot_entries_from_raw_data-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.read_disprot_entries_from_raw_data","text":"read_disprot_entries_from_raw_data(raw_data_dir)\n\nRead DisProt entries from raw_data_dir/disprot/disprot_regions.json.gz.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.remove_files-Tuple{Any}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.remove_files","text":"remove_files(paths)\n\nRemove each file path in paths if it exists. Parent directories are kept.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.run_protein_sequence_clustering-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.run_protein_sequence_clustering","text":"run_protein_sequence_clustering(input_fasta_path;\n    threads = Sys.CPU_THREADS,\n    global_cluster_memory_limit = \"16G\",\n    global_min_coverage = 80.0,\n    global_min_identity = 30.0,\n    local_min_identity = 80.0,\n    local_min_ungapped_length = 10)\n\nRun protein-level clustering in two modes:\n\nglobal mode: diamond cluster followed by diamond recluster with configurable identity and mutual coverage,\nlocal mode: all-vs-all diamond blastp filtered with configurable identity and minimum ungapped length.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.summarize_dataset_labels_by_binding-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.summarize_dataset_labels_by_binding","text":"summarize_dataset_labels_by_binding(\n    dataset_stats;\n    dataset_label_column\n)\n\nSummarize protein and cluster counts by dataset label, including IDR-binding annotation counts.\n\nRequired dataset_stats columns:\n\nfinal_cluster_id\nprotein_has_idr_binding_annotation\ndataset_label_column\n\nReturned columns:\n\ndataset_label\nn_proteins\nn_final_clusters\nn_idr_binding_proteins\nn_idr_binding_clusters\n\nMissing labels are normalized to the string \"missing\" in dataset_label.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.sweep_disprot_cutoff_label_summaries-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.sweep_disprot_cutoff_label_summaries","text":"sweep_disprot_cutoff_label_summaries(\n    dataset_stats;\n    disprot_testing_cutoff_dates\n)\n\nFor each cutoff date, assign missing cluster fixed labels with assign_missing_cluster_labels_by_disprot_cutoff and compute summary counts via summarize_dataset_labels_by_binding.\n\nThe output includes one row per (disprot_testing_cutoff_date, dataset_label) with labels completed to always include: training, caid, testing.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.utc_now_iso8601-Tuple{}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.utc_now_iso8601","text":"utc_now_iso8601(; clock = () -> now(UTC))\n\nReturn the current UTC timestamp as yyyy-mm-ddTHH:MM:SSZ.\n\nThe clock keyword is injectable to make tests deterministic.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.write_cluster_representatives_csv-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.write_cluster_representatives_csv","text":"write_cluster_representatives_csv(representatives, output_path)\n\nWrite the final cluster-representative table to CSV. If output_path ends with .gz, the CSV is gzip-compressed.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.write_disprot_full_protein_fasta_gz-Tuple{AbstractString, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.write_disprot_full_protein_fasta_gz","text":"write_disprot_full_protein_fasta_gz(disprot_regions_path, output_fasta_gz_path; line_width = 80)\n\nExtract full protein sequences from a DisProt JSON file and save them as compressed FASTA (.fasta.gz).\n\nReturns the number of records written.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.write_download_report-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.write_download_report","text":"write_download_report(report_path; status, timestamp_utc, release, idpo_version,\n    sources, error_message = nothing)\n\nWrite a Markdown report describing the last raw-data download run.\n\nsources must be an iterable of (url, filename) pairs where each filename is expected to live in dirname(report_path).\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.write_fixed_labels_csv_gz-Tuple{DataFrames.AbstractDataFrame, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.write_fixed_labels_csv_gz","text":"write_fixed_labels_csv_gz(fixed_labels_table, output_path)\n\nWrite fixed_labels_table to a gzip-compressed CSV file.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.write_fixed_labels_readme-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.write_fixed_labels_readme","text":"write_fixed_labels_readme(\n    output_path;\n    output_csv_path,\n    output_csv_filesystem_path = output_csv_path,\n    source_cluster_representatives_path,\n    source_disprot_regions_path,\n    source_pdb_release_map_path,\n    source_caid2_binding_fasta_path = nothing,\n    source_caid3_binding_fasta_path = nothing,\n    source_caid_binding_fasta_paths_by_version = Dict(),\n    af2_training_cutoff_date = AF2_TRAINING_DATA_CUTOFF_DATE,\n    fixed_labels_table\n)\n\nWrite a README for the fixed-label derived dataset.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.write_pdb_release_map_csv_gz-Tuple{DataFrames.DataFrame, AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.write_pdb_release_map_csv_gz","text":"write_pdb_release_map_csv_gz(disprot_pdb_map_with_release, output_path)\n\nWrite disprot_pdb_map_with_release as compressed CSV to output_path.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.write_pdb_release_readme-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.write_pdb_release_readme","text":"write_pdb_release_readme(\n    readme_path;\n    output_csv_path,\n    disprot_pdb_map_with_release,\n    failed_pdb_lookups,\n    invalid_merged_pdb_references,\n    batch_size,\n    generated_at_utc = utc_now_iso8601()\n)\n\nWrite a README report for the derived PDB release-date dataset.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#IDRBindingDataset.write_sequence_clustering_readme-Tuple{AbstractString}","page":"Home","title":"IDRBindingDataset.write_sequence_clustering_readme","text":"write_sequence_clustering_readme(output_path;\n    source_disprot_regions_path,\n    source_disprot_regions_size_bytes,\n    disprot_fasta_path,\n    disprot_fasta_size_bytes,\n    representatives_path,\n    representatives_size_bytes,\n    sequence_count,\n    global_cluster_count,\n    local_cluster_count,\n    final_cluster_count,\n    global_method,\n    local_method,\n    global_min_identity,\n    global_min_coverage,\n    local_min_identity,\n    local_min_ungapped_length,\n    generated_at_utc = utc_now_iso8601())\n\nWrite a run README for clustering outputs, including methods and thresholds.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"}]
}
